Note the units involved -- memory here is usually expressed in terms
of Kwords, not Kbytes.

You get 64Kbytes (or 32Kwords) per job, but half of that is devoted
to the BASIC-PLUS RTS, so you should have 32Kbytes (or 16Kwords) left for your
job.

